      <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
        <name>SigningAllowed</name>
        <id>322</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Allow signing</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>اجازه امضا</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Разрешить подписание</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Разрешить подписание</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>İmzalamaya izin ver</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Cho phép ký</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Allow signing</value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
          <segments>SigningAllowed</segments>
        </dataPath>
        <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
        <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
        <handlers>
          <event>OnChange</event>
          <name>SigningAllowedOnChange</name>
        </handlers>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>SigningAllowedExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>324</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>With this personal setting, you can ignore the certificate qualification check when creating and verifying a signature. The signature made by this certificate will not be legally valid, but you can use it, for example, to sign internal documents.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>با این تنظیم شخصی، می‌توانید بررسی صلاحیت گواهی را هنگام ایجاد و تأیید امضا نادیده بگیرید. امضای انجام‌شده با این گواهی اعتبار قانونی نخواهد داشت، اما می‌توانید از آن مثلاً برای امضای اسناد داخلی استفاده کنید.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Эта персональная настройка позволяет игнорировать проверку квалифицированности сертификата при создании и проверке подписи. Подпись, сделанная данным сертификатом, не будет являться юридически значимой, но может использоваться, например, для внутреннего документооборота.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Bu kişisel ayar, imza oluşturulması ve kontrolü esnasında sertifika niteliği kontrolünü görmezden gelmeyi sağlar. Bu sertifikaya yapılan imza hukuki bir değer içermeyecektir, fakat örneğin harici dosyalarda kullanılabilecektir.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Tùy chọn này cho phép bạn bỏ qua các kiểm tra về chất lượng chứng thư khi tạo và xác minh chữ ký. Chữ ký do chứng thư này tạo ra sẽ không có ý nghĩa pháp lý, nhưng có thể được sử dụng, ví dụ, để quản lý tài liệu nội bộ.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>With this personal setting, you can ignore the certificate qualification check when creating and verifying a signature. The signature made by this certificate will not be legally valid, but you can use it, for example, to sign internal documents.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>With this personal setting, you can ignore the certificate qualification check when creating and verifying a signature. The signature made by this certificate will not be legally valid, but you can use it, for example, to sign internal documents.</value>
          </title>
          <type>Label</type>
          <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
            <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
          </extInfo>
        </extendedTooltip>
        <contextMenu>
          <name>SigningAllowedContextMenu</name>
          <id>323</id>
          <autoFill>true</autoFill>
        </contextMenu>
        <type>CheckBoxField</type>
        <groupHorizontalAlign>Right</groupHorizontalAlign>
        <editMode>Enter</editMode>
        <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
        <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
        <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
